Z||000004||theogre||01-24-2001||07:59 PM||||sounds like the sendor or wire. If that one that was changed to white face and back was working before the white face then yes, i'd check the dash out more. you may end up replacing the gauge on that.<P>At least yours are just acting up. A few weaks ago mine simply blew out. It was still showing pressure but would not have for long.... It blew out 2 quarts of oil. Much further and it would have gone dry. Oil was everywhere. I was amazed it didn't catch fire. <P>These senders are real pieces of crap. GM has some newer designs. I'm going to see if I can make one work with Fiero. (This is a rather low priority since I just spent $40 including the oil to replace the dead one.)||||reg||1
